**Andrew Gallant wrote most of the code in `src/`. Ask them first, and pick a second reviewer from the list below.**

I used `git blame -w -M -C -C` on the 8 tracked files under `src/`. It counts lines that exist now and follows moved code. Whitespace changes don't count. This matters because the recent "Move Ancestor" and "Rename src/tests" commits would distort commit counts.

